221:- [Dependency semantics](DEPENDENCY_SEMANTICS.md)
222:- [Development and verification](DEVELOPMENT.md)
223:- [Maintainer map](MAINTAINER_MAP.md)
224:
225:## Notes
226:
227:Arcana graph compilation and Grimoire discovery remain outside Lexicon's ownership boundary.
