172:
173:| Documented concern | Primary implementation | Related tests |
174:| --- | --- | --- |
175:| Grimoire process/protocol integration | `internal/arcanagraph/` | `internal/arcanagraph/*_test.go` |
176:| Arcana command surface | `arcana/src/cli.rs`, `arcana/src/cli_*.rs`, `arcana/src/main.rs` | Arcana CLI tests |
177:| Lexicon snapshot ingestion | `arcana/src/lexicon/` | Arcana Lexicon and sync tests |
178:| Repository compilation and catalogue | `arcana/src/repository/` | repository module tests |
179:| Packed graph and snapshots | `arcana/src/storage/`, `arcana/src/snapshot/` | storage and snapshot tests |
180:| Query protocol | `arcana/src/protocol/` | protocol tests |
181:| Optional vectors | `arcana/src/vector/` | vector tests |
182:
183:Grimoire consumes Arcana through `arcana.query.v1`; it does not read packed graph bytes directly.
